{"symbol":"ABS.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:46:27Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Konrada Wallenroda 4c","city":"Lublin","zip":"20-607","country":"Poland","phone":"48 81 535 3000","fax":"48 81 535 3005","website":"https://www.assecobs.pl","industry":"Software - Application","industryKey":"software-application","industryDisp":"Software - Application","sector":"Technology","sectorKey":"technology","sectorDisp":"Technology","longBusinessSummary":"Asseco Business Solutions S.A. designs and develops enterprise software solutions in Poland and internationally. The company offers enterprise resource planning (ERP) systems, including softlab ERP, macrologic ERP, and wapro ERP for business management of large, medium, and small enterprises, as well as business cloud solutions. It also provides mobile touch, a sales force automation solution; connector, a data integration and management platform, as well as faktor, a factoring solution; and direct portal, an online store platform. In addition, the company offers e-commerce platforms, such as e-commerce standard and e-commerce enterprise; and Faktor, a system designed to support factoring transactions of banks and financial institutions. It serves FMCG, food production, retail, wholesale, construction, automotive, furniture, electrotechnology, and steel industries, as well as HR in logistics and accounting firms. The company was founded in 2001 and is based in Lublin, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":1123,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Wojciech  Barczentewicz","title":"Chairman of Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":1577000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Piotr  Maslowski","title":"Vice President of Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":535000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Mariusz  Lizon","title":"Member of Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":1434000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"M